# Scoped exceptions for Spring Framework 6.2.19 in this application.
# Reviewed against the vendor advisories on 2026-11-04. The conditions below
# are absent in src/main: no XsltView, catch-all implicit view rendering,
# Server-Sent Events, or view fragments. The compatible 6.2.20 fix is
# enterprise-only; Spring Framework 7 is incompatible with Spring Boot 3.5.
# Revisit these exceptions when moving to a compatible fixed Boot release.

# Requires XsltView and a /** mapping that renders an implicit view name.
# https://spring.io/security/cve-2026-47884/
CVE-2026-47884

# Requires Server-Sent Events carrying view fragments.
# https://spring.io/security/cve-2026-47890/
CVE-2026-47890
